\mathrm{df\text{-}reflexive\text{-}transitive\text{-}closure}\vdash
\operatorname{RTC}_X(R)\coloneqq
\Bigl\{(x,y)\in X\times X:
\exists n\in\mathbb N\;\exists s:\{i\in\mathbb N:i\le n\}\to X\;
\bigl(s(0)=x\land s(n)=y
\land\forall i\in\{j\in\mathbb N:j<n\}\;((s(i),s(i+1))\in R)\bigr)\Bigr\}
